		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gargantuan, aquatic beast, capable of capsizing ships in its vortex. Ochre mountain of chitin, spines, and blubber.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite (near) +7 (2d10) and 2 claws (near) +7 (2d8) and vortex, <strong>MV</strong> double near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 3d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ruination</strong>. Double damage to vessels and objects.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vortex</strong>. Far-width whirlpool. STR 18+ or sucked under water and drowning. STR 18+ to escape on turn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
